  "description": "alarms.v1 §2.6: one key's samples, in the owner's stamp order (core §4.2), each {\"put\": its payload, decoded as JSON} or \"delete\" (a delete or a reply_del) -> the transition each one makes against the document held before it: raised, escalated, refreshed, confirmed, resolved, retired, or unreadable (a payload documents.json reads as unreadable, after which nothing is held). The reader starts holding nothing. Two documents are equal when every member §2.4 names is equal."
}
